<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I want to fully follow Jehovah</l><l>All the days of my life.</l><l>Deal with the old man,</l><l>Off to the good land</l><l>To enjoy my Christ.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I want to fully follow Jehovah</l><l>All the days of my life.</l><l>Leave all the matters</l><l>In His safe hands to</l><l>Let Him make His choice.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>I want to fully follow Jehovah</l><l>All the days of my life.</l><l>I’ll pay the price to</l><l>Cross o’er the Jordan</l><l>To possess my Christ.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
